Launcher icons for Pindu launcher

Symbolic icons that stand for the launchers Pindu imports from, in the desktop window and
on fullscreen mode's section tiles (`pindu_core::sections::source_icon`). None of them is
Pindu's own work; each is listed with where it comes from and under what terms it is
used. GTK recolours them to the text colour. Pindu launcher is not affiliated with,
sponsored or endorsed by any of these launchers or stores.

pindu-source-steam-symbolic.svg
  The Steam logo, from Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org> (`icons/steam.svg`, commit
  521c96fd04b0ea93034db8715eda5a4de27a58bb), traced from Valve's branding page
  <https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/marketing/branding>. The file is released under CC0
  1.0 by Simple Icons; the mark is used unchanged under Valve's branding guidelines.
  Steam and the Steam logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve
  Corporation in the U.S. and/or other countries.

pindu-source-lutris-symbolic.svg
pindu-source-bottles-symbolic.svg
pindu-source-legendary-symbolic.svg
  From Cartridges by kramo <https://codeberg.org/kramo/cartridges>
  (`data/icons/sources/{lutris,bottles,legendary}-source-symbolic.svg`, commit
  d56323e6dd0ba9b500ee4f2b11d95f2e6240b05f), unchanged. Copyright (C) 2023 kramo, released
  under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version.
  Lutris's and Bottles' marks belong to their projects; Legendary has no logo, and its
  icon is Cartridges' own design.

