  Changed for GTK's symbolic icons: the stylesheet that set its colour and the class that
  used it are removed, and its fill is black, which GTK replaces with the text colour.

pindu-source-itch-symbolic.svg
  The itch.io logo without its title, from the itch.io press kit
  <https://itch.io/press-kit> (`itchio-textless-black.svg`, last modified 2019-01-03),
  unchanged, used under the press kit's guidelines: not distorted, no effects added, the
  aspect ratio kept, in a colour that contrasts with its background.

Epic Games, GOG and Amazon have no icon here: their sections show a two-letter monogram in
fullscreen mode and a generic icon in the desktop window. Heroic's sideloaded games, the
desktop's games and the games added by hand show GNOME's own icons.
